WEBVTT

1
00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:03.840
<i>Lu-ah la-ah la-ah re</i>

2
00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:08.880
<i>Mah ta-la ta-la ta-la re</i>

3
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:14.800
{\an8}<i>Members of the Ling clan unite</i>

4
00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.280
{\an8}<i>To see the sun of happiness</i>
<i>Shine in the sky...</i>

5
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:23.960
<i>Om mani padme hum...</i>

6
00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:30.720
<i>This song we're singing</i>
<i>Will bring joy to all</i>

7
00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:35.280
<i>Every single song we sing</i>
<i>Is spreading the Buddha's mercy</i>

8
00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:38.400
<i>Wish everyone good luck...</i>

9
00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:43.440
<i>This song we're singing...</i>

10
00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.320
<i>Will bring joy to all</i>

11
00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:48.800
<i>Every single song we sing</i>
<i>Is spreading the Buddha's mercy...</i>

12
00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:03.560
{\an8}SEVERAL YEARS LATER

13
00:26:49.440 --> 00:26:55.240
<i>Fourteen yaks, good and strong</i>

14
00:26:55.360 --> 00:27:00.080
<i>Chori was the one who killed them</i>

15
00:27:00.200 --> 00:27:04.200
<i>With Brugmo being the witness</i>

16
00:27:04.800 --> 00:27:10.400
<i>Whoever breaks the law must be punished</i>

17
00:27:10.520 --> 00:27:14.520
<i>And banished will Chori be from Ling</i>

18
00:27:14.640 --> 00:27:19.800
<i>By a hundred tribesmen blowing white horns</i>

19
00:27:19.920 --> 00:27:25.520
<i>And another hundred shooting arrows</i>

20
00:27:25.640 --> 00:27:28.960
<i>Plus another hundred throwing flour</i>

21
00:27:29.080 --> 00:27:34.600
<i>While the truth remains unknown</i>

22
00:30:36.480 --> 00:30:41.680
<i>In the snowy wilderness...</i>

23
00:30:42.320 --> 00:30:45.720
<i>Yalaso</i>

24
00:30:48.360 --> 00:30:53.520
<i>A trail of footprints is left...</i>

25
00:30:54.440 --> 00:30:57.480
<i>Yalaso</i>

26
00:31:00.120 --> 00:31:06.040
<i>Range upon range of mountains</i>

27
00:31:06.440 --> 00:31:10.160
<i>Yalaso</i>

28
00:31:12.400 --> 00:31:17.840
<i>Stand ahead of the wayfarers</i>

29
00:31:18.600 --> 00:31:21.480
<i>Yalaso</i>

30
00:31:24.240 --> 00:31:28.360
<i>It's a mother's love</i>

31
00:31:28.520 --> 00:31:32.200
<i>That has guarded him</i>

32
00:31:32.800 --> 00:31:35.840
<i>Generations of hero blood</i>

33
00:31:36.280 --> 00:31:42.440
<i>Runs through his veins</i>

34
00:31:43.240 --> 00:31:47.360
<i>The ancient longing</i>

35
00:31:47.480 --> 00:31:51.400
<i>Becomes an eternal faith...</i>

36
00:31:51.520 --> 00:31:55.400
<i>The son of heaven</i>

37
00:31:55.520 --> 00:32:01.440
<i>Will go through trials on earth</i>

38
00:32:07.840 --> 00:32:13.400
<i>Traveling through the stormy nights</i>

39
00:32:13.760 --> 00:32:17.680
<i>Yalaso</i>

40
00:32:19.520 --> 00:32:24.920
<i>A star shines upon my heart</i>

41
00:32:25.520 --> 00:32:30.520
<i>Yalaso</i>

42
00:32:30.680 --> 00:32:37.640
<i>Yalaso</i>

43
00:45:48.640 --> 00:45:53.360
<i>O the splendid saffron blossom</i>

44
00:45:53.480 --> 00:45:57.080
<i>Growing here on the plateau...</i>

45
00:49:39.200 --> 00:49:46.160
<i>Om ah hum vajra guru padma siddhi hum</i>

46
01:02:29.800 --> 01:02:36.760
<i>Beams of sunlight</i>
<i>Scatter across the plateau</i>

47
01:02:38.200 --> 01:02:41.520
<i>The sun rising in the east</i>

48
01:02:41.640 --> 01:02:48.040
<i>Chases away the darkness...</i>

49
01:02:59.840 --> 01:03:03.840
<i>Songs of Drolmala...</i>

50
01:03:54.120 --> 01:04:00.960
<i>Beams of sunlight</i>
<i>Scatter across the plateau</i>

51
01:04:02.400 --> 01:04:05.760
<i>The sun rising in the east</i>

52
01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:12.480
<i>Chases away the darkness...</i>

53
01:05:15.120 --> 01:05:19.600
<i>The sacred snow mountains</i>

54
01:05:19.720 --> 01:05:22.080
<i>Have long kept me company</i>

55
01:05:23.080 --> 01:05:29.600
<i>The magic canyons</i>

56
01:05:29.760 --> 01:05:33.920
<i>Are where my heart belongs</i>

57
01:05:34.120 --> 01:05:38.440
<i>This land we call home</i>

58
01:05:38.600 --> 01:05:43.080
<i>Is where we are raised</i>

59
01:05:43.240 --> 01:05:46.640
<i>And with the beautiful galsang flowers</i>

60
01:05:46.760 --> 01:05:53.720
<i>Love spreads on</i>

61
01:05:54.120 --> 01:05:58.680
<i>This land we call home</i>

62
01:05:58.880 --> 01:06:03.160
<i>Is where we are raised</i>

63
01:06:03.280 --> 01:06:06.680
<i>And with the beautiful galsang flowers</i>

64
01:06:07.160 --> 01:06:13.760
<i>Love spreads on</i>

65
01:11:16.360 --> 01:11:21.640
<i>The legend of the great hero</i>

66
01:11:21.880 --> 01:11:27.520
<i>Goes on and on</i>

67
01:24:08.960 --> 01:24:15.440
<i>Our sweetest home</i>

68
01:24:17.480 --> 01:24:24.440
<i>The sincerest wishes... yalaso</i>

69
01:24:27.480 --> 01:24:34.440
<i>The beautiful galsang flowers bloom</i>

70
01:24:39.240 --> 01:24:46.080
<i>In every heart</i>

71
01:24:49.960 --> 01:24:54.120
<i>Yalaso</i>

72
01:24:57.760 --> 01:25:01.400
<i>Yalaso</i>

73
01:34:10.080 --> 01:34:13.400
<i>For the horse race of Ling heroes gather</i>

74
01:34:13.760 --> 01:34:17.400
<i>Among them is the reincarnated</i>
<i>Divine child</i>

75
01:34:17.520 --> 01:34:21.040
<i>Three monsters are expelled by his spell</i>

76
01:34:21.160 --> 01:34:24.200
<i>On a galloping horse</i>
<i>He rides towards victory</i>

77
01:34:24.920 --> 01:34:28.120
<i>Uniting the people, fighting off enemies</i>

78
01:34:28.240 --> 01:34:32.000
<i>Chori shall be the one</i>
<i>Who leads the world...</i>

79
01:41:19.400 --> 01:41:26.280
<i>Chosen by Buddhas and Dakini</i>

80
01:41:26.400 --> 01:41:33.160
<i>He will be the subduer of foes</i>

81
01:41:34.840 --> 01:41:40.360
<i>Wish-fulfilling jewel for good souls</i>

82
01:41:40.480 --> 01:41:43.640
<i>Chori, the Divine Child...</i>

83
01:41:43.760 --> 01:41:48.080
<i>...Descends from heaven</i>
